The two faces the handset's type roles resolve against (plan 0077 stage 1),
vendored so `go:embed` can reach them (embed only takes in-module files).
Both are SIL OFL 1.1 — the license texts sit beside the ttfs.

  Inter-Bold.ttf, Inter-Medium.ttf        INTER-LICENSE.txt
    https://github.com/rsms/inter (release 4.x desktop ttfs)
  AtkinsonHyperlegible-Bold.ttf,          ATKINSON-LICENSE.txt
  AtkinsonHyperlegible-Regular.ttf
    https://www.brailleinstitute.org/freefont/
    (also https://github.com/googlefonts/atkinson-hyperlegible)

Atkinson Hyperlegible has no Medium cut, so the strike table maps its
"medium" entries to the Regular ttf.
